<title>SINGAPORE: Mayfran to buy Malaysian property.</title>
<headline>Mayfran to buy Malaysian property.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Mayfran International Ltd said on Tuesday it has agreed to buy a property in Malaysia for 5.33 million ringgit.</p>
<p>The company, which produces bed sheets and other household linen, said the acquisition would allow it to relocate its manufacturing operations to Johor where operating costs are lower.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
